  "causes": [
    "Distant paper could not mount/produce an in-window frame before the camera waiting on its readiness could move. One existing settlement now approaches with the cover closed, then opens the exact ready paper.",
    "An invalidated addressed read lost the preparation destination; full reload could replace accepted preparation with the still-closed camera demand. Epoch/pin guards remain; actual camera and source demand are separately checked.",
    "SwiftUI task-id delivery could suppress another same-frame composition publication. The installed native presentation owns one coalesced scheduled request; old task-id path removed.",
    "Canonical deletion/transfer proof must be installed before owner cancellation; active normalized presence cannot be rejected in an endless reload. Deleted selection is cleared after callback; a transferred live selection is retained.",
    "Ink refinement followed general active presence rather than actual camera motion, producing a late density-only resize and revoked readiness after landing.",
    "Plain generated Markdown needlessly loaded every print package; its existing AST walk now requests actual dependencies, while opaque authored TeX retains its complete environment."
  ],
